                    "svg": "<svg viewBox=\"0 0 1100 1100\" class=\"lesson-visual\">\n                    <rect x=\"0\" y=\"0\" width=\"1100\" height=\"1100\" fill=\"#1a1a2e\"/>\n                    <text x=\"550\" y=\"70\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#ffd700\" font-weight=\"bold\" font-size=\"36\">WISDOM</text>\n                    <text x=\"550\" y=\"115\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#888\" font-size=\"24\">The opening of the Comedy</text>\n                    <rect x=\"80\" y=\"280\" width=\"940\" height=\"360\" rx=\"20\" fill=\"rgba(139,92,246,0.1)\" stroke=\"#8b5cf6\" stroke-width=\"2\"/>\n                    <text x=\"550\" y=\"350\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#fff\" font-style=\"italic\" font-size=\"26\">\"Midway upon the journey</text>\n                    <text x=\"550\" y=\"395\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#fff\" font-style=\"italic\" font-size=\"26\">of our life,</text>\n                    <text x=\"550\" y=\"460\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#fff\" font-style=\"italic\" font-size=\"26\">I found myself within</text>\n                    <text x=\"550\" y=\"505\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#fff\" font-style=\"italic\" font-size=\"26\">a forest dark,</text>\n                    <text x=\"550\" y=\"570\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#fff\" font-style=\"italic\" font-size=\"26\">for the straightforward pathway</text>\n                    <text x=\"550\" y=\"615\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#fff\" font-style=\"italic\" font-size=\"26\">had been lost.\"</text>\n                    <text x=\"900\" y=\"730\" text-anchor=\"end\" fill=\"#8b5cf6\" font-size=\"22\">— Dante, Inferno 1.1-3</text>\n                    <text x=\"550\" y=\"830\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#888\" font-size=\"20\">\"Nel mezzo del cammin di nostra vita...\"</text>\n                </svg>",
                    "caption": "One of literature's most famous openings"
